@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@token = replace-with-access-token

### 登录并获取访问令牌
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"account":"admin","password":"replace-with-initial-password","rememberMe":false}

### 仪表盘真实统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询当前用户通知
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询菜单管理树
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu-management
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询组织机构树
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询审计日志
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 修改当前用户密码
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"replace-current-password","newPassword":"replace-new-password"}
